----------------------------------------------------------------------
External dependencies referenced (not redistributed)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The following components are referenced by the agent at runtime and must be
obtained directly from their authors. They are NOT redistributed in this
repository. See README.md for instructions.

  - Derm1M  (PanDerm encoder + Image RAG)
            https://github.com/SiyuanYan1/Derm1M
  - MAKE    (concept annotation encoder)
            https://github.com/SiyuanYan1/MAKE
  - DermoGPT (dermatology VQA model)
            https://github.com/mendicant04/DermoGPT
  - MM-Skin / SkinVL-PubMM (SkinVL baseline framework + weights)
            Code:    https://github.com/ZwQ803/MM-Skin
            Weights: https://huggingface.co/zwq803/SkinVL-PubMM
            Paper:   Zhang et al., "MM-Skin: Enhancing Dermatology Vision-
                     Language Model with an Image-Text Dataset Derived from
                     Textbooks." arXiv:2505.06152.
  - Qwen3-VL, Qwen3-Embedding, Qwen3-Reranker
            https://huggingface.co/Qwen
  - Qdrant  (vector database)
            https://qdrant.tech

